  "description": "\nDe-conversion of No.26 back as one dwelling with the amalgamation of Flat A and B to provide one family home.\nNo. 26:\nReplacing existing windows with wood effect PVC double glazed sliding sash windows.\nRelocation of 1st floor back addition side and rear window. \nReplace the existing from door with a painted hardwood door with two glazed panels.\nNew front garden brick wall.\n\nNo. 28 Mendora Road:\nDemolition of garden store building \n\nNo. 26 & 28 Mendora Road:\nJoint ground floor side return infill extension, 3m high on the dividing boundary with a flat roof. New double-glazed aluminium framed  sliding doors across rear elevations. Double glazed flat roof lights in the flat roof of the extension.  ",
